[l_english.MODULE_PROJECTILE_4B_HOTIRONBALL]
Heated Iron Ball

[l_english.MODULE_PROJECTILE_4B_HOTIRONBALL_desc]
According to previous statistics, our enemies often try to catch iron balls with balloons and trampolines, and then use them as ammunition to attack us. So we decided to let their skin doctors on the field work overtime.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PROJECTILE_4B_HOTIRONBALL]
烧红的铁球

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PROJECTILE_4B_HOTIRONBALL_desc]
根据此前的统计，我们的敌军常常试图用气球和蹦床接住铁球，然后用作弹药反过来攻击我们，于是我们决定让他们的皮肤科战地医生加班。
